# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Izlaz piši: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), novi-red.
Izlaz piši: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), novi-red.
Izlaz piši: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), novi-red.
Izlaz piši: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), novi-red.
Izlaz piši: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), novi-red.
Izlaz piši: ([''] tccompare: ['']), novi-red.
